# src/apps/daemon/internal/networking/fronting

## Purpose
Implements domain/fronting-oriented daemon networking behavior used by supported transport and evasion paths.

## Contents
Contains Go configuration, dialing, and protocol helpers for fronting-capable connections.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Called by networking/routing orchestration and depends on HTTP/TLS/socket primitives and validated transport configuration.

## Invariants
Fronting targets and outbound destinations are validated before use, TLS/security policy is not silently weakened, cancellation reaches in-flight I/O, and failed setup releases all connection resources.